Name: drafting
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-10-05
Author: Andreas Bertsatos
Maintainer: Andreas Bertsatos <abertsatos@biol.uoa.gr>
Title: Geometry, CAD Input/Output and Technical Drawing
Description: Planar geometry, technical drawing and solid modelling:
 polylines, splines, paths and regions with booleans, offsets and hulls;
 a technical drawing model plotted, printed to scale, set in TikZ and
 written to DXF; DXF read and written from R12 to R2018; triangle meshes
 in STL, OBJ, PLY and 3MF; and, when built with Open CASCADE, exact solids
 with holes, fillets, sections and projections, assemblies in STEP and
 3MF, and a viewer.  Provides the drafting layer for engineering design
 packages.
Categories: Graphics
Depends: octave (>= 11.1.0)
BuildRequires: libocct-foundation-dev (>= 7.8.0), libocct-modeling-data-dev,
 libocct-modeling-algorithms-dev, libocct-data-exchange-dev,
 libocct-visualization-dev, libx11-dev
Url: https://github.com/pr0m1th3as/drafting
Tracker: https://github.com/pr0m1th3as/drafting/issues
